# Redis Engineering

A daily hands-on Redis learning journey focused on building practical backend engineering challenges and understanding how Redis is used in real-world backend systems.

## Topics

* Redis Data Types
* TTL & Expiration
* Caching
* Pipelines
* Pub/Sub
* Queues
* Rate Limiting
* Distributed Systems Concepts

## Progress

| Day | Challenge                 | Concepts                 |
| --- | ------------------------- | ------------------------ |
| 01  | OTP Management System     | TTL, EXPIRE, PERSIST     |
| 02  | Bank Transfer System      | MULTI, EXEC, WATCH       |
| 03  | Product Bulk Cache System | Pipelines, Batching, TTL |

More challenges will be added as I learn and implement new Redis concepts.

## Goal

Build consistently, understand the underlying concepts, and document practical Redis implementations through hands-on coding.
